WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:04.740
With James Gunn of Guardians of the Galaxy
fame in the director's chair, another outing

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:06.879
for the
Suicide Squad has come to fruition.

00:00:06.879 --> 00:00:08.790
Here's what we know so far.

00:00:09.790 --> 00:00:14.580
With it now approaching five years since 2016's
Suicide Squad premiered in theaters, the wait

00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:18.780
for the second installment in the franchise
has gone on longer than most, largely due

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:21.090
to the first movie's negative reception.

00:00:21.090 --> 00:00:26.110
Thankfully, die-hard DC fans don't have to
test their patience much longer because James

00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:33.260
Gunn's The Suicide Squad will arrive in theatres
everywhere and HBO Max on August 6, 2021.

00:00:33.260 --> 00:00:38.600
Because of the continued concerns around COVID-19
and the global pandemic, Warner Bros. is continuing

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:43.410
to release all of its movies to both theatres
and premium streaming service for the foreseeable

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:44.770
future.

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:48.909
The cast of The Suicide Squad is huge and
has a nice blend of old and new.

00:00:48.909 --> 00:00:53.690
A handful of members from the 2016 version
will be returning, and they'll be accompanied

00:00:53.690 --> 00:00:55.739
by a colorful crew of newcomers.

00:00:55.739 --> 00:01:00.409
As far as returning names go, Margot Robbie
will reprise her role as Harley Quinn.

00:01:00.409 --> 00:01:05.150
Joel Kinnaman reprises his role as military
man Rick Flag, Jai Courtney will swing back

00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:09.860
around to his Captain Boomerang alter-ego,
and the mastermind of Task Force X, Amanda

00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:14.300
Waller, will grace the big and small screen
alike thanks to Viola Davis.

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:18.300
Beyond the returning cast, get ready for a
laundry list of fresh faces.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:24.300
The newcomers include Idris Elba as Bloodsport,
Mayling Ng as Mongal, Flula Borg as Javelin,

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:30.331
John Cena as Peacemaker, Peter Capaldi as
The Thinker, Alice Braga as Sol Soria, Pete

00:01:30.331 --> 00:01:35.930
Davidson as Blackguard, David Dastmalchian
as Polka-Dot Man, Michael Rooker as Savant,

00:01:35.930 --> 00:01:42.580
Nathan Fillion as T.D.K., Storm Reid as Tyla,
Daniela Melchior as the second Ratcatcher,

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:48.650
Sylvester Stallone as King Shark, Sean Gunn
as Weasel, Juan Diego Botto as Silvio Luna,

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:54.350
Joaquín Cosío as Mateo Suárez, Jennifer
Holland as Emilia Harcourt, and John Ostrander

00:01:54.350 --> 00:01:55.860
as Dr. Fitzgibbon.

00:01:55.860 --> 00:01:59.770
Taika Waititi is also believed to have an
undisclosed role in the film.

00:01:59.770 --> 00:02:04.080
Some of these characters, such as King Shark,
a monstrous humanoid shark who played a popular

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:09.379
role in TV's Arrowverse, and Bloodsport, who
famously shot Superman with kryptonite, both

00:02:09.379 --> 00:02:13.540
in the comics and the film, are known for
being fan-favorites in the comics.

00:02:13.540 --> 00:02:17.519
Other new members are B-list villains that
Gunn has presumably reworked to fit the humorous

00:02:17.519 --> 00:02:18.580
tone and narrative.

00:02:19.580 --> 00:02:23.200
If there's one thing that the Suicide Squad
is known for in the comics, other than being

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:27.739
a team of bad guys forced to do good guy work,
it's the fact that their missions quite often

00:02:27.739 --> 00:02:30.159
involve half the team winding up dead.

00:02:30.159 --> 00:02:34.379
Because of that, it's worth noting that becoming
attached to any member of the Suicide Squad

00:02:34.379 --> 00:02:36.370
isn't exactly the wisest choice to make.

00:02:36.370 --> 00:02:40.519
It's not a question of whether any of them
will die, but rather, which ones.

00:02:40.519 --> 00:02:43.990
James Gunn has hinted that it's not out of
the question that only two members of the

00:02:43.990 --> 00:02:46.799
lineup will reach the end of the movie in
one piece.

00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:51.500
Fans have speculated that Harley Quinn, Rick
Flag, and Amanda Waller are the most likely

00:02:51.500 --> 00:02:54.400
to come out unscathed thanks to their "franchise
armor."

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:58.819
Gunn has responded though with:
"No character was protected by DC.

00:02:58.819 --> 00:03:01.139
They gave me carte blanche to do what I wanted."

00:03:01.139 --> 00:03:05.879
That also goes for new favorites, such as
Sylvestor Stallone's King Shark, who, thanks

00:03:05.879 --> 00:03:10.590
to the trailers, has already become beloved
by the fandom for his simultaneously bloodthirsty

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:12.430
and cuddly personality.

00:03:12.430 --> 00:03:16.700
Doubling these concerns is that Gunn has a
reputation for killing off beloved characters,

00:03:16.700 --> 00:03:19.620
as seen in both Guardians of the Galaxy films
to date.

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:22.700
You’ll likely have to say goodbye to more
than one of your favorites.

00:03:23.830 --> 00:03:27.730
Keeping in line with both the massive cast
and the revised aesthetic, it appears that

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:32.069
the entire plot of The Suicide Squad will
go in a vastly different direction than the

00:03:32.069 --> 00:03:33.069
first movie.

00:03:33.069 --> 00:03:37.099
According to James Gunn and producer Peter
Safran, the team's mission will take them

00:03:37.099 --> 00:03:40.749
to the fictional Latin American island of
Corto Maltese.

00:03:40.749 --> 00:03:44.239
Safran revealed:
"There they have to destroy a Nazi-era prison

00:03:44.239 --> 00:03:49.359
and laboratory named Jotunheim, where political
prisoners were held and experimentations took

00:03:49.359 --> 00:03:50.359
place."

00:03:50.359 --> 00:03:53.279
Gunn added that some “horrid secrets”
will come to light.

00:03:53.279 --> 00:03:57.010
Speaking of horrid, the film's second trailer
made it clear the leader of the Task Force

00:03:57.010 --> 00:04:01.189
X operation, Amanda Waller, is up to the same
shady stuff as usual.

00:04:01.189 --> 00:04:06.180
It appears that Idris Elba's character, Bloodsport,
is forced to join the team against his will

00:04:06.180 --> 00:04:08.610
when Waller seemingly threatens his daughter.

00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:09.610
Her reasoning?

00:04:09.610 --> 00:04:14.239
"I wouldn't take such extreme measures if
this mission weren't more important than you

00:04:14.239 --> 00:04:15.680
can possibly imagine.

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:17.919
Are you in or out?"

00:04:17.919 --> 00:04:21.769
What is that threat, and how does it tie into
Nazi experiments?

00:04:21.769 --> 00:04:25.310
While Warner Bros. and the creative team have
been keeping the plot's various mysteries

00:04:25.310 --> 00:04:29.490
close to their chests, it has been revealed
that the team will be told to destroy everything

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:32.060
related to something called Project Starfish.

00:04:32.060 --> 00:04:37.720
And as the trailer reveals, this project appears
to involve a classic DC villain named Starro,

00:04:37.720 --> 00:04:42.180
who is, well, a Godzilla-sized starfish creature
with psychic powers.

00:04:42.180 --> 00:04:46.690
In the comics, it was the first opponent that
the Justice League of America ever faced down.

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:49.650
Nobody ever claimed that Silver Age comics
were subtle.

00:04:49.650 --> 00:04:54.150
Starro might be outlandish, but given the
tone of Gunn's The Suicide Squad, this colossal

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:56.210
foe will likely make a perfect fit.

00:04:57.250 --> 00:05:00.960
Warner Bros. has released several trailers
for The Suicide Squad, with the most recent

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:02.830
one hitting the internet on June 22.

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:04.419
"Hey, guys Sorry I'm late.

00:05:04.419 --> 00:05:06.330
I had to go number two."

00:05:06.330 --> 00:05:07.330
"Good to know."

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:11.590
Every release has received an enthusiastic
response from fans and even garnered massive

00:05:11.590 --> 00:05:15.449
interest from those who were disappointed
in the 2016 film.

00:05:15.449 --> 00:05:19.270
While the trailers don't appear to give away
the movie's big secrets or reveal which of

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:23.180
the villainous do-gooders will bite the bullet,
they do make it clear that this is, for the

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:28.370
most part, a different Task Force X than the
one assembled in the prior movie, and for

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:29.419
a different reason.

00:05:29.419 --> 00:05:33.370
Perhaps the biggest accomplishment of the
trailers is how they broadcast the snarky,

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:38.240
humorous tone that the movie will take, true
to James Gunn's style, while also containing

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:43.159
emotional beats that ring true, particularly
concerning Bloodsport's family connections,

00:05:43.159 --> 00:05:47.200
or Harley Quinn being genuinely touched that
the team was going in to save her life.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:51.990
Already, DC fans online are forming connections
to the new characters featured in the trailers,

00:05:51.990 --> 00:05:56.420
as each one appears to have a unique, fascinating
backstory, from the depressed and sulking

00:05:56.420 --> 00:06:01.190
demeanor of the ridiculous Polka-Dot Man to
the discomfort that Weasel causes among his

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:02.280
fellow supervillains.

00:06:02.280 --> 00:06:06.439
Naturally, Gunn and Warner Bros. are probably
trying to make sure that viewers connect to

00:06:06.439 --> 00:06:09.139
these characters before they start killing
them off.

00:06:10.139 --> 00:06:13.180
Is The Suicide Squad a sequel or a reboot
of the 2016 film?

00:06:13.180 --> 00:06:14.819
That's the big question.

00:06:14.819 --> 00:06:19.020
The returning cast members imply that it's
a continuation, but the wildly different tone

00:06:19.020 --> 00:06:20.020
says the opposite.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:22.750
Then there’s the title: The Suicide Squad.

00:06:22.750 --> 00:06:26.199
It’s extremely similar to the original film,
but with "The" attached.

00:06:26.199 --> 00:06:29.479
Warner Bros. is going all in with “The”
- The Batman...

00:06:29.479 --> 00:06:34.490
The Suicide Squad the possibilities are endless
for reboots/ sequels with the word “The”

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:36.470
in front of existing movie titles!

00:06:36.470 --> 00:06:39.830
Apparently, it's technically neither a sequel
nor a reboot.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:44.470
While Gunn has confirmed that the movie is
set in the DCEU, it's also clear that this

00:06:44.470 --> 00:06:49.699
version is not continuing the style, tone,
or dangling plot threads of the first release.

00:06:49.699 --> 00:06:52.160
That explains why it's not actually a sequel.

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:56.979
In other words, if you liked the 2016 movie,
you can link the two movies, but if you didn't

00:06:56.979 --> 00:07:01.270
like the original film, or avoided it like
the plague, Gunn himself confirmed that nothing

00:07:01.270 --> 00:07:04.659
in his movie necessitates seeing the 2016
version.

00:07:04.659 --> 00:07:09.069
Producer Peter Safran, meanwhile, has said
that Gunn's film was going to be a "total

00:07:09.069 --> 00:07:12.909
reboot," but it seems he meant that more in
the sense of it resetting the series, rather

00:07:12.909 --> 00:07:15.009
than DCEU continuity.

00:07:15.009 --> 00:07:17.449
You can ignore the 2016 version or not.

00:07:17.449 --> 00:07:19.000
It’s completely up to you.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:23.949
That said, while Gunn is very much doing his
own thing in his own way, he's been very cordial

00:07:23.949 --> 00:07:26.270
toward David Ayer's movie.

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:29.110
Gunn explained:
"I think the original film did some amazing

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:32.389
casting on those characters, in particular
the ones I used.

00:07:32.389 --> 00:07:36.099
I changed what I wanted to and kind of didn't
fix what wasn't broken."

00:07:37.099 --> 00:07:41.800
John Cena's shiny-helmeted character, Peacemaker,
will be coming back in an HBO Max series in

00:07:41.800 --> 00:07:43.449
early 2022.

00:07:43.449 --> 00:07:48.259
James Gunn is the creative force of the upcoming
Peacemaker TV series, having written all the

00:07:48.259 --> 00:07:49.889
show's eight episodes.

00:07:49.889 --> 00:07:54.139
While Peacemaker, known in the comics for
being an "extremist pacifist" who loves peace

00:07:54.139 --> 00:07:58.080
so much that he'll kill for it, has always
been a cult-favorite character, it seems like

00:07:58.080 --> 00:08:01.969
John Cena's take on the role must have been
impressive enough that Gunn wanted to keep

00:08:01.969 --> 00:08:03.030
a good thing going.

00:08:03.030 --> 00:08:07.520
Gunn, for his part, describes Peacemaker as
the "world's biggest douchebag," and sees

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:10.150
the series as a way to explore real-world
issues.

00:08:10.150 --> 00:08:14.250
However, before you go assuming that this
ensures Peacemaker's survival in The Suicide

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:16.069
Squad, think again.

00:08:16.069 --> 00:08:18.770
The HBO Max series is set to delve into the
character's beginnings.

00:08:18.770 --> 00:08:22.490
Don't forget, Marvel only released a Black
Widow movie after Endgame.

00:08:22.490 --> 00:08:27.610
When it comes to The Suicide Squad, it's safe
to say that no one, Peacemaker included, is

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:28.610
safe.

